  "private": true,
  "description": "Bidder-side domain logic and components: lot card, bid sheet, buy-now sheet, photo carousel/lightbox, watchlist toggle, live bid ticker, plus the recently-viewed and saved-searches stores. Consumed by bidder-mobile.",
